/**
 * Swap: seven building blocks standing in the slots of a tray, one of them
 * half lifted. The block under the pointer lifts clear of its slot, showing
 * the empty slot below, and its neighbours part, staggered outward from it, so
 * one block can be replaced without touching the rest. The slider is the gap.
 *
 * The pattern: discrete items. Tweens, a stagger by distance, a reach with a
 * floor, and a hit test on the RESTING centres along the row.
 */
